{"seq":3,"slug":"debris-management","title":"碎屑管理与 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/simulation/debris-management","wordCount":1776,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"碎屑管理与-lod\">碎屑管理与 LOD</h1><p>一场持续几分钟的巷战，如果每一块被打下来的碎片都永远留在地上、永远参与物理，那么十分钟后场景里会有上万个刚体，帧率必然崩塌。碎屑管理回答的就是「碎块碎开之后，如何在不破坏观感的前提下让它们尽快、优雅地消失或降级」。这是破坏系统里最不「炫」却最决定项目能否上线的一环。它与<a href=\"debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>的分工是：那篇讲单个碎块怎么正确地动，这篇讲一大群碎块作为整体如何被限量、降级、回收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>碎屑管理是为「只生不灭」的碎块群建立的一套生命周期与限额机制。核心是<strong>碎块生命周期</strong>——生成→活跃→休眠→淡出→回收，其中休眠只退出物理求解（仍占内存、仍渲染），回收才真正释放，两者不可混淆。围绕它有三类手段：<strong>限量策略</strong>（全局数量上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、时间寿命、距离淘汰，通常叠加）、<strong>极小碎屑降级</strong>（把视觉噪声级的碎屑移出物理系统、改用 VFX 粒子或批量渲染）、<strong>破坏 LOD</strong>（按距离同时降级碎块数、碰撞精度、休眠阈值与碎屑寿命）。内存侧则用<strong>对象池</strong>消除生成/销毁的分配尖峰，配合离线预计算的质量数据与连续内存布局。贯穿其中的仍是「感知优先」原则：淡出要让玩家察觉不到退场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"碎屑的生命周期\">碎屑的生命周期</h2><p>每个脱落碎块都应有一条明确的生命周期，而不是「生成后就撒手不管」。典型的四个阶段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[生成: 从连接图释放] --&gt; B[活跃: 全物理模拟&lt;br/&gt;翻滚碰撞]&#10;  B --&gt; C[休眠: 速度低于阈值&lt;br/&gt;退出求解, 仍可见]&#10;  C --&gt; D{超时或超预算?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[淡出: 缩小/透明/沉入地面]&#10;  E --&gt; F[回收: 归还对象池]&#10;  B --&gt; G{极小碎屑?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[短寿命&lt;br/&gt;快速淡出]\">flowchart TD\n  A[生成: 从连接图释放] --&gt; B[活跃: 全物理模拟&lt;br/&gt;翻滚碰撞]\n  B --&gt; C[休眠: 速度低于阈值&lt;br/&gt;退出求解, 仍可见]\n  C --&gt; D{超时或超预算?}\n  D --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| E[淡出: 缩小/透明/沉入地面]\n  E --&gt; F[回收: 归还对象池]\n  B --&gt; G{极小碎屑?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[短寿命&lt;br/&gt;快速淡出]</pre><p>关键在于<strong>休眠不等于销毁</strong>。休眠（见<a href=\"debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>）只是退出物理求解，碎块还占着内存、还在渲染。真正的回收发生在淡出之后。淡出手段有讲究：直接「啪」地消失会被玩家察觉，因此常用缩小、渐透明、或缓慢沉入地面等方式，让碎块在玩家不注意时退场。这套淡出正是<a href=\"../foundations/why-destruction\">为何要做破坏系统</a>里「感知优先」原则的直接应用——只要玩家没盯着，怎么省怎么来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种限量策略\">三种限量策略</h2><p>碎屑失控的根源是「只生不灭」。必须有硬性上限。三种策略通常叠加使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>权衡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局数量上限</td>\n<td>活跃碎块数达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>生成新碎块时</td>\n<td>简单，但可能淘汰玩家正看的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间寿命</td>\n<td>每碎块存活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 秒后淡出</td>\n<td>计时器</td>\n<td>稳定，但热闹场景显空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离淘汰</td>\n<td>超出玩家一定距离即回收</td>\n<td>每帧检查</td>\n<td>自然，但需空间查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>全局上限最关键：当活跃碎块数逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，系统按「最老、最小、最远、已休眠」的优先级淘汰旧碎块给新碎块腾位置。淘汰时同样走淡出而非瞬灭。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的取值直接由帧预算倒推——每个活跃刚体的平均求解成本乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须落在破坏分到的毫秒预算内，这个量化在<a href=\"destruction-performance\">性能与预算</a>里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极小碎屑的特殊处理\">极小碎屑的特殊处理</h2><p>破坏会产生大量「视觉噪声级」的小碎屑：一发子弹打在混凝土上崩出的几十粒石渣。让它们每粒都做完整刚体物理，是纯粹的浪费——它们太小，玩家看不清个体运动，却占满了刚体名额。业界普遍<strong>把极小碎屑降级出物理系统</strong>，改用更便宜的表示：</p>\n<p>其一，用 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/\">VFX 粒子系统</a>代替刚体。小石渣本质上和火花、烟尘同类，用 GPU 粒子模拟一次性抛洒、简单地与地面碰撞、几秒后消失，成本比刚体低一两个数量级。其二，用共享的「碎屑网格」批量渲染，避免每粒一个 draw call。UE5 Chaos 官方文档明确建议：碎成极小片的碎块「个体行为怪异且对整体破坏观感无贡献」，应通过 debris 移除设置直接剔除。判断「小」的标准通常是体积或包围盒尺寸低于某阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>debris</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{debris}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">debris</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，碎裂时就把这些块分流到粒子/装饰通道，根本不进刚体求解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lod-按距离降级破坏\">LOD：按距离降级破坏</h2><p>和网格渲染一样，破坏本身也分 LOD（细节层次）。核心思想是<strong>离玩家越远，破坏做得越糙</strong>，因为远处的破坏在屏幕上只占几个像素，精细模拟完全浪费。</p>\n<p>破坏的 LOD 体现在多个维度同时降级：远处物体碎成更少的块（用<a href=\"../fracture/voronoi-fracture\">层级碎裂</a>的浅层）、碎块用更粗的碰撞代理甚至纯运动学、休眠阈值更激进、碎屑寿命更短、极小碎屑直接不生成。最激进的一档 LOD 甚至用一段预烘焙的破坏动画代替实时物理——远处一栋楼倒塌，玩家根本分不清是模拟还是播片。这套按距离切换破坏保真度的思路，与渲染和<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/practice/performance-budgets-lod\">VFX 的 LOD</a>完全同源，实现上也常复用引擎统一的 LOD 距离分级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存与对象池\">内存与对象池</h2><p>碎屑的另一半成本是内存与分配。爆炸瞬间生成几十个刚体，若每个都现场 new 出来、销毁时 delete，会产生分配尖峰与内存碎片，甚至触发 GC 卡顿。标准解法是<strong>对象池</strong>：预先分配一批碎块刚体对象，生成时从池里取、回收时还给池，全程零运行时分配。池的大小按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 预留，确保最坏情况也不触发新分配。</p>\n<p>这套池化与<a href=\"debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>里质量属性的离线预计算配合：碎块从池中取出时，直接套用烘焙好的几何与质量数据，无需任何运行时几何处理。内存布局上，把池中的碎块数据连续存放还能改善缓存命中——这与数据导向设计一脉相承，通用原理见 <a href=\"../../entity-component-system/data-layout/memory-cache-locality\">ECS · 内存与缓存局部性</a>。内存管理的通用手段则见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">性能优化 · 内存管理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>碎块生命周期是 生成→活跃→休眠→淡出→回收；休眠只退出求解，回收才释放，淡出要让玩家察觉不到退场。</li>\n<li>全局数量上限、时间寿命、距离淘汰三策略叠加限量；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由破坏的毫秒帧预算倒推。</li>\n<li>极小碎屑降级出物理系统，改用 VFX 粒子或批量渲染；UE5 官方建议直接剔除无观感贡献的极小片。</li>\n<li>破坏 LOD 按距离同时降级碎块数、碰撞精度、休眠阈值、碎屑寿命，最远档用预烘焙动画替代实时物理。</li>\n<li>对象池消除生成/销毁的分配尖峰与 GC 卡顿，配合离线预计算的质量数据与连续内存布局。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>单碎块的物理与休眠：<a href=\"debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>；碎块来源与层级：<a href=\"../fracture/voronoi-fracture\">Voronoi 碎裂</a></li>\n<li>数量上限的预算量化：<a href=\"../practice/destruction-performance\">性能与预算</a></li>\n<li>跨库：碎屑降级为粒子的做法，见 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/practice/performance-budgets-lod\">VFX 与粒子系统 · 性能预算与 LOD</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碎屑管理与 LOD","id":"碎屑管理与-lod"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"碎屑的生命周期","id":"碎屑的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"三种限量策略","id":"三种限量策略"},{"level":2,"text":"极小碎屑的特殊处理","id":"极小碎屑的特殊处理"},{"level":2,"text":"LOD：按距离降级破坏","id":"lod-按距离降级破坏"},{"level":2,"text":"内存与对象池","id":"内存与对象池"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"约束与连接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/simulation/joint-constraints"},"next":{"title":"破坏的性能与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/practice/destruction-performance"}}